# The listen address comes from scripts/testhost (-o ListenAddress=...).
PasswordAuthentication yes
KbdInteractiveAuthentication yes
# A disposable box: root may log in (same per-run password) to install things. Under gVisor
# (rootless) setuid binaries such as sudo do not elevate; under crun they do.
PermitRootLogin yes
AllowUsers tester root
PrintMotd yes
Banner none
